{
 "batchId": "b-0072",
 "sourceSetHash": "2bb765198fa14f1818bc2d39e1c2b0b4fbcca43e35fd776b7cdd9a4bea65a84f",
 "locale": "ja",
 "units": [
  {
   "id": "t_587a7ecd90da6f890b71",
   "sourceHash": "587a7ecd90da6f890b7103d17581c12384d24e903ba8e8c1ef3d9052ae3ab869",
   "text": "4件の質問",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_0f6413c1d4186c6bfc81",
   "sourceHash": "0f6413c1d4186c6bfc81750e762c10979dd847900b88213616e6141cf3129d34",
   "text": "アーユルヴェーダとは何ですか？どのように役立ちますか？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_d0acac163d1ff0407536",
   "sourceHash": "d0acac163d1ff04075365aee318c59a8196ef52c0e42e97bd69fa90c91301f72",
   "text": "アーユルヴェーダの考え方を日常生活に取り入れるにはどうすればよいですか？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_4df96341f0c5a92c4aa0",
   "sourceHash": "4df96341f0c5a92c4aa00a8e5754fe6625ec6df953d18d1466feda28f6ebed6a",
   "text": "日の出前に起き、午後10時までに就寝する",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_778cb3d407904cd47e0b",
   "sourceHash": "778cb3d407904cd47e0beb177ff52baa920786a72b807d4edeb9d4c717e58915",
   "text": "新鮮な旬の食材で、意識的に食事をする",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_89beaccf1403393b8a19",
   "sourceHash": "89beaccf1403393b8a19449d314cbf7ef9a65dc387a5f6c1ee1bd41a40867549",
   "text": "一日を通して温かいお湯で水分を補給する",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_4c7fd2722bf175c12fd2",
   "sourceHash": "4c7fd2722bf175c12fd2bf7606bab02aaecf922e6bb36f4a7474c8ac1016df26",
   "text": "ヨガや散歩など、穏やかな運動を取り入れる",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_0aee999add0257c4dac4",
   "sourceHash": "0aee999add0257c4dac4b1abdb6596d815f6e357eee0de68b59d84fbac0dff7f",
   "text": "適切なオイルを用いてオイルプリングやセルフマッサージ（アビヤンガ）を行う",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_db9c37e4e583ef2e627c",
   "sourceHash": "db9c37e4e583ef2e627c98b3af019526fb1ba37749f45937ad2342891d6522e5",
   "text": "優勢なドーシャ（体質）に合わせて食事を調整する",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_a665646ddb31acb01209",
   "sourceHash": "a665646ddb31acb012090bd53e09267b18074105b23cb9b9fcf3fe1993aa1295",
   "text": "ご滞在中は、医師が一人ひとりに合わせたアドバイスを行います。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_cdc7b3222cfcf68836f3",
   "sourceHash": "cdc7b3222cfcf68836f3a398b33fecf0373fe0bcd2b46987f252cc88e446450c",
   "text": "ドーシャとは何ですか？なぜ重要なのですか？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_9d4ec006de42f4e97c2d",
   "sourceHash": "9d4ec006de42f4e97c2d1186a167a111f0b799aa7fd6663a372e2568b0ceb311",
   "text": "ドーシャとは、身体と心のあらゆるはたらきを司る三つの生体エネルギー、すなわち[[OPEN_1]]ヴァータ[[CLOSE_1]]（風と空）、[[OPEN_2]]ピッタ[[CLOSE_2]]（火と水）、[[OPEN_3]]カパ[[CLOSE_3]]（地と水）のことです。ご自身に固有のドーシャの構成を理解することで、体質に最も適した治療、食事、生活習慣を判断しやすくなります。Kairaliでは、到着時に詳しいドーシャ評価を行い、あなたに合わせた治療プログラムを組み立てます。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'wellness program' rendered as 治療プログラム (treatment programme) per clinical register."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_f1571223ecba3298a5f6",
   "sourceHash": "f1571223ecba3298a5f67e8452920d700823c1505c49741eb0d82c6eadcb2f0b",
   "text": "アーユルヴェーダの医師は正規の医師ですか？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_12ef40d99add8bb35fed",
   "sourceHash": "12ef40d99add8bb35fedfb44aab7d497462584c1c55b6a87b7d850bd335e5381",
   "text": "はい。インドのアーユルヴェーダ医師は、アーユルヴェーダと現代医学の臨床研修を含む五年半のBAMS（Bachelor of Ayurvedic Medicine and Surgery：アーユルヴェーダ医学・外科学士）課程を修了しています。さらに三年をかけて専門課程（アーユルヴェーダのMD）に進む医師も多くいます。アーユルヴェーダ医学はWHOに認められており、インドではAYUSH省によって規制されています。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_44e23e059aece4a9315b",
   "sourceHash": "44e23e059aece4a9315b1a65d9c61453ecc847732f44b1136a69dc2e0a61230f",
   "text": "詳しくは[[OPEN_1]]ナレッジセンター[[CLOSE_1]]をご覧ください。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_b1737b2b446a9c40231f",
   "sourceHash": "b1737b2b446a9c40231fed72718cdd0f62ed09c15cad46b85376ab51f07e0320",
   "text": "治療とプログラム",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_8b241a7be356eef3d101",
   "sourceHash": "8b241a7be356eef3d10180a68e651b5a8f6912bd79a751ed7760a5014e97d5cf",
   "text": "5件の質問",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_ce8c37570a75cfa295dc",
   "sourceHash": "ce8c37570a75cfa295dc2861b66b812c19e52c43c78b35391b19ca84c6299c99",
   "text": "消化器系の不調（過敏性腸症候群、胃酸の逆流、便秘）",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_8df888f4f75068df1dcb",
   "sourceHash": "8df888f4f75068df1dcb9089700aa5fee3daff94112664b6ce70f8e3b2d87ef0",
   "text": "呼吸器系の症状（喘息、アレルギー、副鼻腔炎）",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_6ae03227a543e0fc528e",
   "sourceHash": "6ae03227a543e0fc528e123276db0e4014534c062379ce598ba5dcaf3776d8db",
   "text": "関節や筋肉の痛み（関節炎、腰痛）",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_bac831d62ea3ab0612c2",
   "sourceHash": "bac831d62ea3ab0612c2aff03333fe576d3b02f27973b260c0d11b686b91fb8b",
   "text": "ストレス関連の不調（不安、不眠、疲労）",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_6a9d60dd6130057c8400",
   "sourceHash": "6a9d60dd6130057c8400b66bd0cf7e3d50ebf14175d87b8dafdd579843cb14fb",
   "text": "皮膚の症状（乾癬、湿疹、にきび）",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  }
 ]
}
